"
Package manifest for VectorGraphics — a Pharo port of the Cuis Smalltalk VectorEngine.

Provides anti-aliased vector graphics rendering (strokes, fills, Bézier curves, arcs,
ellipses) and TrueType font rendering, integrated with Pharo's Morphic Canvas API.

## Package tags
- kernel        — VectorCanvas, VectorEngineAbstract, VectorEnginePixel, WholePixel, SubPixel
- PathCommands  — SVG path command objects (PathCommand and subclasses)
- TrueType      — TrueType font loading and rendering (TTFontReader, TTFontDescription, etc.)
- tests         — SUnit test cases and test helpers
- Examples      — runnable example methods (VectorCanvasExample, TrueTypeExample)

Original source: https://github.com/Cuis-Smalltalk/Cuis-Smalltalk-Dev/blob/master/Packages/Features/VectorEnginePlugin.pck.st
"
Class {
	#name : 'ManifestVectorGraphics',
	#superclass : 'PackageManifest',
	#category : 'VectorGraphics-Manifest',
	#package : 'VectorGraphics',
	#tag : 'Manifest'
}
